BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Lazy Eyes 'Cheesy Love Songs' Tour
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20261009T200000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20261010T040000
UID:fun-time-pony-59a4d1481fb120e6019a9471eccaf151
DESCRIPTION:The Lazy Eyes return this September and October for a national
  tour celebrating their second album Cheesy Love Songs (out 21 August). Fo
 llowing sold-out shows across Australia\, the UK and US\, the Sydney four-
 piece will bring their acclaimed live show to capital cities and regional 
 centres\, performing new tracks alongside fan favourites like Fuzz Jam and
  Where's My Brain???. The tour marks an exciting new chapter for one of Au
 stralia’s most captivating young bands.
